			    MAX('Leads'[Aging Matrícula]),
			    USERELATIONSHIP('Leads'[Data Criacao], 'dCalendario'[Date])
			)
			
			
			```
		formatString: 0
		lineageTag: 87637f5d-a09b-4320-ab6e-d594c0ba31b2

